[2026-10-25 18:59:09] [INFO] [map] POPUP show tag=DIPLO_TALK kind=message title="-" ctx=(a=3 b=0 payload=0) body=""{Mighty} Viceroy Michiel De Ruyter, we again welcome you to {United States of America}. Please remember that we have justly claimed all of this land in the name of {our Queen and the Church of England}.  We continue in our efforts to seek a life of {religious freedom} and service to the Crown.""
